<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Twenty Five Style</title>

<style>

:root {
  --font-serif: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
  --text: #111;
  --background: #fff;
  --width: 760px;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--background);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.container {
  width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--width));
  margin: auto;
}


/* Header */

header {
  padding: 40px 0;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 28px;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
}

nav a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}


/* Hero */

.hero {
  padding: 90px 0;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(50px, 8vw, 90px);
  font-weight: normal;
  line-height: 1;
  margin: 0 0 30px;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 42px;
  font-weight: normal;
}


/* Sections */

section {
  margin: 90px 0;
}


blockquote {
  border-left: 3px solid #111;
  padding-left: 25px;
  font-style: italic;
}


/* Footer */

footer {
  border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
  padding: 40px 0;
  margin-top: 80px;
  color: #555;
}


/* Mobile */

@media(max-width:600px){

header {
  display:block;
}

nav {
  margin-top:20px;
}

body {
  font-size:18px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>


<header class="container">

<div class="logo">
My Journal
</div>


<nav>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#writing">Writing</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>


</header>



<main class="container">


<section class="hero">

<h1>
A quiet place for ideas.
</h1>


<p>
A minimalist publishing page inspired by
WordPress Twenty Twenty-Five, built with
classic typography and generous space.
</p>


</section>



<section id="about">

<h2>
About
</h2>

<p>
Welcome to my personal space for essays,
stories, photography and creative work.
</p>

</section>



<section id="writing">

<h2>
Latest Writing
</h2>


<article>

<h3>
The Beauty of Simplicity
</h3>

<p>
Good design removes distractions and allows
content to become the centre of attention.
</p>


<blockquote>
"Content first. Design second."
</blockquote>


</article>


</section>



<section id="contact">

<h2>
Contact
</h2>

<p>
email@example.com
</p>

</section>



</main>



<footer class="container">

© 2026 My Journal

</footer>



</body>
</html>
